---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config';
---
<section id="about" class="py-20 sm:py-20 bg-body">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-4xl reveal" data-reveal>
      <p class="section-label">About Me</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">From lab notebooks to fintech</h2>
      <div class="space-y-3.5 text-base text-text-light leading-[1.8] max-w-[700px]">
        <p>
          I'm a full-stack developer working with React, Node.js, and TypeScript.
          I started out on Ruby on Rails and pick up new stacks as projects need
          them.
        </p>
        <p>
          I currently develop the credit reconciliation platform at Credit Box,
          a Tel Aviv fintech startup. Before that, I built and maintained an
          Electronic Lab Notebook (ELN) for biotech research at Biodata.
        </p>
        <p>
          I leverage AI-assisted development tools - agentic workflows with
          Claude Code and Opencode, custom skills, and context-driven prompting -
          to design systems, debug efficiently, and maintain high test coverage.
          I treat them as a force multiplier, not a crutch.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm based in Petah Tikva, Israel, and always happy to chat about new
          opportunities, clean code, or what the market's doing today.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 reveal reveal-delay-2" data-reveal>
        <a
          href={SITE_CONFIG.github}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-accent">
          GitHub
        </a>
        <a
          href={SITE_CONFIG.linkedin}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="btn-accent">
          LinkedIn
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
